  "message": "<p>Dear {{ doc.line_manager_name }},</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    <strong>{{ doc.employee_name }}</strong> has submitted their KRA & Goal Setup \r\n    for the <strong>{{ doc.cycle_year }}</strong> performance cycle and is pending \r\n    your review.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Below is a summary of the submitted goals:</p>\r\n\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; font-size:13px;\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr style=\"background:#1e3a5f; color:#fff;\">\r\n            <th style=\"padding:8px 12px; text-align:left;\">KRA</th>\r\n            <th style=\"padding:8px 12px; text-align:left;\">Goal Description</th>\r\n            <th style=\"padding:8px 12px; text-align:center;\">Weightage</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        {% for row in doc.kra_and_goal_detail %}\r\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\r\n            <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\">{{ row.kra_name }}</td>\r\n            <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\">{{ row.goal_description }}</td>\r\n            <td style=\"padding:8px 12px; text-align:center;\">{{ row.weightage_ }}%</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        {% endfor %}\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<!-- CTA Button -->\r\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 24px 0;\">\r\n            <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n                <tr>\r\n                    <td style=\"border-radius:8px; background:#1e3a5f;\">\r\n                        <a href=\"{{ frappe.utils.get_url() }}/app/kra-and-goal-setup/{{ doc.name }}\"\r\n                           style=\"display:inline-block; padding:14px 32px; \r\n                                  font-size:15px; font-weight:600;\r\n                                  color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none;\r\n                                  border-radius:8px; letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\r\n                            🔍 &nbsp; Open &amp; Review KRA Goal Setup\r\n                        </a>\r\n                    </td>\r\n                </tr>\r\n            </table>\r\n            <p style=\"margin-top:10px; font-size:11px; color:#9ca3af;\">\r\n                Or copy this link to your browser:<br>\r\n                <span style=\"color:#1e3a5f;\">\r\n                    {{ frappe.utils.get_url() }}/app/kra-and-goal-setup/{{ doc.name }}\r\n                </span>\r\n            </p>\r\n        </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n    Once inside the document, use the <strong>Approve</strong> or \r\n    <strong>Reject</strong> button to make your decision. If you choose to \r\n    <strong>Reject</strong>, please fill in the <strong>Rejection Reason</strong> \r\n    field so the employee can make the necessary revisions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"color:#6b7280; font-size:12px; margin-top:24px; border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb; padding-top:12px;\">\r\n    This is an automated notification. Please do not reply to this email.\r\n</p>",
